This package implements the 2D and 3D structure-tensor orientation analysis
method described by:
- R. Rezakhaniha, A. Agianniotis, J. T. C. Schrauwen, A. Griffa, D. Sage,
  C. V. C. Bouten, F. N. van de Vosse, M. Unser, N. Stergiopulos,
  "Experimental investigation of collagen waviness and orientation in the
  arterial adventitia using confocal laser scanning microscopy",
  Biomechanics and Modeling in Mechanobiology, 11(3–4), 461–473 (2012).
- Z. Püspöki, M. Storath, D. Sage, M. Unser,
  "Transforms and Operators for Directional Bioimage Analysis: A Survey",
  Advances in Anatomy, Embryology and Cell Biology, 219, 69–93 (2016).
